Rāma asks Lavaṇa food conduct dwelling --- Sages describe Lavaṇa eating beings especially ascetics at Madhuvana --- Rāma vows to kill rākṣasa and end fear --- Rāma asks Bharata or Śatrughna to take Lavaṇa task --- Bharata volunteers to kill Lavaṇa --- Śatrughna rises pleading Bharata already suffered at Nandigrāma --- Rāma assigns Śatrughna to kill Lavaṇa and rule Madhu city --- Rāma orders Śatrughna accept Vasiṣṭha consecration without reply